sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant pr as Calling repo PR
  participant wf as gitleaks-reusable
  participant gl as gitleaks binary
  pr->>wf: workflow_call (gitleaks-version input)
  wf->>wf: checkout caller (full history) and this repo
  Note over wf: version must match x.y.z or the job fails
  wf->>gl: download release, install
  wf->>gl: scan base..head range with repo or shared config
  gl-->>pr: pass, or fail with redacted findings
